# Tech Stack

- Next.js (App Router only)
- Tailwind CSS
- Payload CMS
- TypeScript
- npm (this repo)

## Architecture
- Server Components by default
- Mutations: keep existing `/api/app/*` routes; Server Actions are optional for new work — do not replace working API routes
- Prefer Payload Local API on the server
- Clean separation between UI and business logic

Improve the current app in place. Do not remove or rebuild working features.
